  "vulnerable_cycle": 3,
  "state_register": "state_q",
  "result_register": "auth_result_q",
  "explanation": "A clock glitch injected at the cycle where the FSM transitions from COMPARE to DECIDE can cause the auth_result_q register to skip its update while the state_q register advances. This leaves a stale pass value in auth_result_q from a previous successful authentication, granting unauthorized access without a valid comparison."
